---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import en from '../i18n/en.json';

const lang = 'en';
const dict = en;
---

<Layout
  lang={lang}
  title="Terms of Use | DJ Fruits and Dry Fruits Exports"
  description="Terms governing procurement quotations, physical lot inspection, and certified weighing protocols."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <div class="section-opaque legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last updated: 11 October 2026</p>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Procurement Rates & Quotations</h2>
        <p>
          Individual lot procurement rates are confirmed only following physical inspection, berry sizing, and brix/moisture assessment at your farm gate or our Manerajuri packhouse. Final purchase agreements are negotiated privately based on lot quality and grade.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Farm Lot Registration Slips</h2>
        <p>
          The online lot registration slip is an intake memo to coordinate farm visits and collection logistics. The official purchase receipt is issued upon certified electronic platform scale weighing at our Manerajuri packhouse or authorized farm collection vehicle.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Payment & Settlement</h2>
        <p>
          Direct payments are made electronically via NEFT / RTGS to verified grower bank accounts following grading acceptance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 4.5rem 0 6rem;
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 780px;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--canopy);
  }
  .legal-date {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--canopy);
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
